# Creating Test Cases (QA Focus)

Write test cases in JSON format:

```json {all|2-3|4-5|6-7|8-12|all}
{
  "name": "Test GET User",
  "description": "Verify user retrieval API",
  "method": "GET",
  "url": "https://api.example.com/users/1",
  "headers": {},
  "expected_status_code": 200,
  "body": {
    "userId": 1,
    "title": "test title",
    "body": "test body"
  }
}
```

Tips:
- Use descriptive names
- Include complete endpoints
- Specify expected responses
- Add relevant headers

