# Test Implementation (Developer Focus)

Core test execution logic:

```python {all|1-4|6-12|14-19|all}
def execute_test_case(test_case):
    """
    Execute a single API test case with performance monitoring
    """
    # Extract test configuration
    method = test_case['method']
    url = test_case['url']
    headers = test_case.get('headers', {})
    body = test_case.get('body', None)
    expected_status = test_case.get('expected_status_code', 200)

    try:
        # Performance monitoring
        start_time = time.time()
        response = requests.request(method, url, 
                                 headers=headers, 
                                 json=body, 
                                 timeout=10)
        response_time = round((time.time() - start_time) * 1000, 2)
```

