# FastAPI Integration (Developer Focus)

REST API endpoints implementation:

```python {all|1-5|7-11|13-21|all}
class TestRequest(BaseModel):
    """Pydantic model for test request validation"""
    input_file_name: str
    output_file_name: str

@app.get("/")
def read_root():
    """Health check endpoint"""
    return {"Name": "API Test Automation", 
            "Version": "1.0"}

@app.post("/run-tests/")
async def run_tests(request: TestRequest):
    """Execute test suite and generate report"""
    try:
        apitest.run(
            input_file_name=request.input_file_name,
            output_file_name=request.output_file_name
        )
        return {"status": "success"}
    except Exception as e:
        raise HTTPException(status_code=500, detail=str(e))
```

